          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Our beloved thieves Fujiko and Robin have managed to escape from the Money City police. However, citizens are not happy with this situation, that's why they have decided to create a new search team to catch them once and for all and restore stability …",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
